CALLCONV y5 class=0x80 target=0x716 parms=[] ret=0:0
n16 CGFEName y5 TY_CODE_PTR
c17 CGInitCall n16 TY_INTEGER y5
n18 CGFEName y1 TY_CODE_PTR
- CGAddParm c17 n18 TY_CODE_PTR
